 <p>Checked on 20 October 2026. The shop and quantities are invented. The SQL results above were executed on native PostgreSQL 18.6, in temporary tables on a disposable database. No concurrent sessions or production-scale work were measured. The seven figures calculate illustrative logical states, checked against that run; their animation is not an engine trace.</p>
