  <li>PostgreSQL 18: <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-insert.html">INSERT</a>, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-update.html">UPDATE</a>, <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-delete.html">DELETE</a> and <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/sql-merge.html">MERGE</a>: syntax, source cardinality, conflicts and direct counts.</li>
