  <li><a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/functions-sequence.html">Sequence Manipulation Functions</a>: sequence allocations and rollback; <a href="https://www.postgresql.org/docs/18/tutorial-transactions.html">Transactions</a>: transaction completion and rollback.</li>
